TI  - Challenging Patriarchy: The Transformation of Women's Roles Under Saudi Arabia's Vision 2030
T2  - Impact of Patriarchy and Gender Stereotypes on Working Women: Exploring Its Past, Present and Future
PY  - 2025
SP  - 121
